<title>USA: Garfield, N.J., won by PNC Capital.</title>
<headline>Garfield, N.J., won by PNC Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PNC Capital said it won $4.356 million of Garfield, N.J., general improvement bonds, with the lowest rate of 5.30, highest price of 100.146.</p>
</text>
